    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a8d77a5bcd7a61e7655cfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆则表达自身的决心。\n她要展现甚至能覆盖过那些记忆的强悍，\n并掀起革命──这就是她的回礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d79847ff8f312f5e0e9d5520898209ab404cd058762100aefbea0c681943c27d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
