    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd1b043ad524798999108d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆因为\n在经典级就夺下“天皇赏（秋）”冠军等，\n多数出色的成绩获得肯定，接受了特别专访。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b6a5cd8554c45999bd55669f5271d52458b53c9af6e7bebf78b330470e5f85b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
