    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1c838e86ea3242900aece4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为累积至今的“成果”，世人接纳了她的耿直。\n而在强悍实力的帮助下，\n大家也以友善态度接纳了她的冷淡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca607d0bfbc5e5926c632c259cf8f280ab53ba851352bd6302efadd1d5ef4f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083404.json",
      "json_path": [
