      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5192b58d06310f676c330267",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，跳舞城阐述了她的“浪漫”。\n她想为同伴建造一座巨大的城堡，\n因此要靠比赛提升知名度赚大钱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7a3fd8d43c5796b5ed265bfb5e056d68f83208a438b0065cc3e70a92ae61fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f0c3c8c44087ae51044213",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2185736def09cb298c0f8983",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了“浪漫”，她向吉兆宣战，\n表示自己会在“宝冢纪念”获胜。\n而这份热情不禁令人联想到谷野美酒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "153f7501d9a9391bbe8393c2650e8655162e1c19c71cf64a1a662b6ed1b6f2ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5afd46df62fe2de330f336c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ebb6914bafd768cd087ce6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆感觉到自己\n并没有如这两人般的热情。\n但她决定不再多想，专注下个目标“宝冢纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9154506c8b7b5bf052ac6b8905015d252dfc3d1b64a11424ffb42ff1b69c0827",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083404.json",
      "json_path": [
