    {
      "uid": "zhcn:768acc9a2eeaeef9dcb9d359",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆向训练员吐露心声。\n她对没有“热情”的自己\n是否能掀起“革命”抱持疑问。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e8a0a25bc828e812d5d28b80e3884a1c65864916742c1344a0ed2a5e8e470d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6467a6398809d0f9bb46afe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51d90e4d77b9701bd5d9a0da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但训练员表示，她并不需要“热情”。\n因为其他赛马娘试图赢过\n吉兆的“冷风”，正熊熊燃烧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b202237b911ceffd2c9ecbb7bcd3a9a35e94aa75cc98c8c2c2a4273539a812a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083405.json",
      "json_path": [
