    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dff7795eba7d1be126021f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她以在“天皇赏（秋）”、“日本杯”与\n“有马纪念”全都跑出成果为目标。\n首先下定决心要在“天皇赏（秋）”达成连霸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18d413ecbf6bbd85bb65025b6a332cd90efefe6b1e4185decac61462862524d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
