      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战当天。 \n吉兆与平时一样冷静沉着，\n但正式比赛会带给她多少负担仍是未知数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8ad85dcf1891c6de5048390e2c3d41951c62a70a4cbdbe09f09a78dedc4ce95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
