    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd11a5ffcedf73e20693dba0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "邀请她到学园的鲁道夫象征，\n以及同期的谷野美酒都来观战了。\n吉兆的出道战终于要开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5531016ae0a0137fcefb0b8bc28135f7f1a491104581e3b8831d895358f05fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
