    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d466182eeca32ffb92cea6be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f80d0188546fe77b262180b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但吉兆表示，\n这是她考量诸多因素后决定的。\n无关魔咒，重要的是跑出“成果”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6de40eb046a882e5fb88e9406f9c58fe72e459ce1b5087cbcfa947d8e8858f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083409.json",
      "json_path": [
