    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c83ae91f0c9e27c387c2a7dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是到了“青叶赏”当天。\n吉兆就跟平时一样\n干劲十足地想跑出“成果”，前往比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c5d2a873a1d6df8106bd38f5d4c6e684d9f1efddfe8b4d5e186ad352c81175",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
