    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d30a00e8b651e6dd7b4e163",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员直到比赛当天仍怀抱着不安。\n其实他很想变得跟吉兆一样\n毫不动摇，并且与她并肩屹立。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d185a3f0ab9adddbc39f05938136228366991251841e0a11416b0cd67e22292",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083410.json",
      "json_path": [
