    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3cd64ea840b38005682f45c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再来他们有不同之处也是很重要的。\n正因为双方能够提出各自的意见、同心协力，\n才能来到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c65a270b5ccff00a6f3c22753a8e2dbfdf76c3cac1d7ad35befe6954dd0e5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
