    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da52af3191ba61878a813970",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来到亮相圈，\n吉兆从谷野美酒身上，\n感受到如同刺骨寒风般不寻常的气息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6b120ede749cb624318c5755d6a37125803d59202cc693fffb752eba2d408bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
